{
  "question": "For an NYC small purchase above the micropurchase limit, how many vendors must be solicited from the bidders list?",
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "For an NYC small purchase above the micropurchase limit, at least five vendors must be solicited from the appropriate citywide small purchases bidders list. If the bidders list consists of fewer than five vendors, all vendors on the list must be solicited. This rule is set by New York City.",
